From: Theo GOUREAU <theo.goureau-ext@st.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Mar 2025 09:42:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 824/841] feat(stm32mp2): add support for CA35SS voltage
 scaling

Edit the previous implementation of SMC services for CA35SS clock
scaling to add support for voltage scaling using SCMI. These services
are meant to be used by the STM32MP2 CA35SS clock controller in Linux.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 74dec0100c4cdc509f92be786c7c26d511afdabe feat(stm32mp2): add support for CA35SS voltage scaling]
